 "$comment": "UDine M2 design tokens: the single source for the React Native (mobile/src/lib/m2.generated.ts) and Flutter (tokens.dart) bake-off stacks. Units: px = dp, ms, unitless ratios, rgba(r,g,b,a) strings. Every token path two levels deep has a `trace` entry naming the M2 rule it comes from (~/.cache/udine-scratch/flows/M2/src.html, CONCEPT.md). Generated TS: `pnpm tokens` in /mobile; mobile/src/lib/m2.generated.test.ts fails when it is stale. Easings: a bezier array [x1,y1,x2,y2] is a cubic-bezier; a name (\"emphasized\") resolves through `curves` (emphasized is the M3 two-segment path in `curves.emphasized`), \"linear\" is linear, and [0,0,0,1] is the standard decelerate. `rnOnly` lists the tokens only the React Native stack needs (no M2 rule): Flutter may ignore them. A timing token with `always` plays under the OS reduced-motion setting.",
